		<<set _wifeHasChildren = (_wife.family?.kids ?? []).length > 0>>
		<<set _wifeInfertile = (_wife.traits ?? []).includes('infertile')>>
		<br />
		<<=setup.displayName(_wife)>> doesn't like men. That's not something she's gone out of her way to say, but it's not a secret either.<br />
		She looks at you, then at <<=setup.displayName(_husband)>>, and the discomfort is visible even as she holds herself together.
		<br /><br />
		<<set _inNameOnlyOptions = [
